{% extends "shell.njk" %}{% block body %}<h1>Privacy</h1><p>FinOps LLM collects information you choose to send by email or through booking flows, plus basic site analytics.</p><p>After you consent via our cookie banner, we use Google Analytics 4 to collect anonymized page-view data (page URL, referrer, approximate location, browser, device type; IP addresses are anonymized by GA4), and <a href="https://clarity.microsoft.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Microsoft Clarity</a> to understand how visitors use this site through behavioral metrics, heatmaps, and session replay. Clarity sets cookies and captures usage data (such as clicks, scrolling, and pages viewed); by default it masks sensitive content such as form inputs. This data is processed by Microsoft in accordance with the <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Microsoft Privacy Statement</a>. Neither analytics tool loads until you accept - decline, or clear the consent cookie, to opt out. You can also use your browser's "Do Not Track" / global privacy control settings or block cookies.</p><p>For audit work, the default scope is read-only billing and usage metadata. Prompt and output content is not required for baseline attribution and is only reviewed with explicit approval for a specific optimization.</p><p>To request access, correction, export, or deletion, email <a href="mailto:hello@finopsllm.com">hello@finopsllm.com</a>.</p><p><a href="/">Back to FinOps LLM</a></p>{% endblock %}
